sults in a false statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-4x+1 \\\\ (-1) & =-4(1)+1 \\\\ -1 & =-3\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point $B$ does not lie on the line.\n\n- Substituting the point $C(2,-7)$ results in a true statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-4x+1 \\\\ (-7) & =-4(2)+1 \\\\ -7 & =-7\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point $C$ does lie on the line.\n\nFinally, only point $C$ lies on the line."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186498703 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3123f8ed-a1ca-52b7-8427-2f3b60d9e68a" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Points That Lie on a Line"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0944b8cd-a8ad-5881-872d-cc7841b124b3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$A$ and $C$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186498663} {:answer/id #uuid "0a037906-7560-5a7f-af3a-df39ea31c7f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$B$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186498664} {:answer/id #uuid "2e04fce8-d81f-5c10-9a2d-ce00e7cc6157" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$B$ and $C$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186498674} {:answer/id #uuid "64c6d466-8db0-5469-a154-b446a630e557" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$C$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186498685} {:answer/id #uuid "cb659afb-f587-5d6a-8397-672e2e9f924f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$A$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186498709}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0944b8cd-a8ad-5881-872d-cc7841b124b3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$A$ and $C$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186498663} :answer-field/id #uuid "9124fd28-3c96-58aa-a8b1-46f977a63903" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186498694}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "b0bb51db-df3a-5c24-9053-c8f5081141e9" :quest